---
title: 'Press start: the site is now a game'
date: 2026-11-21
summary: Pick a totem, complete quests, unlock achievements. Every project also got its own card art.
art: game-layer
---

bogmode.ca now plays like a game.

- **Pick your totem.** There are five animals and each one has its own division and skin. Switch any time from the Totem wheel in the nav.
- **Quests and achievements.** Look around and the meter fills up. There are seven achievements to unlock. Progress stays in your browser.
- **A cheat code.** It's hidden. If you know, you know.
- **New About page.** It's shorter, with a player profile card and a press-start contact block.
- **Every project has its own identity.** Each project has its own colours, wordmark and motif on its card and page banner.

Next up: live demos on every project page.
